mode: "100644"
text: "# Scope, distinctions + connections\n\ncampaign-and-launch-planning is a **strategy/orchestration skill** — it plans the time-boxed campaign (goal,\nphases, week-by-week map, the brief, the per-platform posts) and **WoopSocial schedules + publishes the\ncoordinated social posts** on the timeline. The agent **plans + writes + schedules the social side**; the\n**waitlist/hub, email, ads, checkout, press, and livestream are external/native.**\n\n## Honest scope (never violate)\n- **The agent** plans the campaign, writes the **one-page brief** + the **week-by-week map** + the **posts**,\n  and designs the phases/urgency/hero moments.\n- **WoopSocial schedules + publishes the coordinated social posts** across the connected platforms on the\n  planned timeline (`SCHEDULE_FOR_LATER` + per-platform fields; validate via `platform-specs-and-validation`).\n  This is the launch's coordinated-publish engine.\n- **WoopSocial does NOT:** host the **waitlist / landing page / campaign hub**, send the **email sequence**\n  (an ESP does), process **checkout / the sale**, run **paid ads**, do **press/creator outreach** (human/DM),\n  run the **livestream** (native — `livestream-and-realtime`), or measure **conversions/ROI** (native\n  analytics + the store).\n- **Credible urgency only** — no fake/resetting countdowns, no invented scarcity or signup counts. **Never\n  fabricate** anticipation or results. **Coordinate, don't spam** (hero moments, not hourly blasts).\n  **Verify-quarterly.**\n\n## Distinct from its siblings\n- **campaign-and-launch-planning (this)** — the **time-boxed spotlight campaign** (phases toward one goal).\n- **content-calendar** — the **ongoing always-on cadence** (the lights, not the spotlight).\n- **goals-and-kpis** — the **targets** a campaign serves (read first).\n- **collabs-and-cross-promotion** / **lead-magnets-and-funnels** / **email-and-newsletter** /\n  **link-in-bio-and-traffic** / **livestream-and-realtime** / **ugc-and-influencer** — the **pieces a launch\n  orchestrates**, each owned by its skill.\n\n## Where this connects\n- **Reads first:** `brand-profile` (audience/voice), `goals-and-kpis` (the goal + metric);\n  `competitor-analysis` (positioning/timing).\n- **Orchestrates:** `lead-magnets-and-funnels`/`link-in-bio-and-traffic` (the hub/waitlist),\n  `email-and-newsletter` (the parallel sequence), `collabs-and-cross-promotion`/`ugc-and-influencer` (press/\n  creator/partner moments), `livestream-and-realtime` (the launch live), the **format skills** +\n  `thumbnail-design` (the assets), `cross-platform-repurposing` (one asset → many cuts).\n- **Publishes via:** `scheduling-and-queue → WoopSocial` (the coordinated timeline) +\n  `platform-specs-and-validation` (validate each post); `content-calendar` reserves the campaign's slots.\n- **Measures with:** `analytics-and-reporting` (per-channel numbers vs targets) + the store/landing page;\n  `experimentation-and-ab-testing` (A/B the headline/creative). **Hub, email, ads, checkout, press, live + conversion\n  measurement stay external/native.**\n"
